name: MyOS Document Bootstrap Mandate
type: Mandate/Document Responder Mandate
description: >
  MyOS-hosted responder mandate allowing sessions of the inherited
  authorizedInitialDocument to request bootstrap work from MyOS Admin. The
  canonical subtype constrains the guarantor and authorized-actor roles to
  MyOS Admin. Allowed document, channel-binding, initial-message, and
  on-behalf-of constraints are expressed through inherited validation.
